# Live Vercel (zeroed-two.vercel.app) sends only HSTS + cache-control
# max-age=0 must-revalidate (+ ACAO on HTML). Do not invent XFO / XSS /
# Permissions-Policy / Referrer-Policy / nosniff — production does not.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
